286
00:15:53,140 --> 00:15:57,460
Uh, how is Kageyama doing?

287
00:15:58,040 --> 00:15:59,280
Uh, he's fine.

288
00:15:59,620 --> 00:16:00,740
Except during test week.

289
00:16:02,180 --> 00:16:02,620
Okay.

290
00:16:03,300 --> 00:16:04,000
