His playing style has...

294
00:16:08,800 --> 00:16:10,720
Changed quite a bit since I knew him.

295
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:11,440
Hmm?

296
00:16:12,700 --> 00:16:15,320
You need to stop worrying about what happened in middle school.

297
00:16:17,260 --> 00:16:20,040
What you did back then, you thought best.

298
00:16:20,260 --> 00:16:21,400
Uh, whatever.

299
00:16:21,400 --> 00:16:23,220
We're just talking, okay?

300
00:16:25,900 --> 00:16:27,320
