301
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:33,240
Is this about the time when no one would hit Kageyama's sets?

302
00:16:34,820 --> 00:16:37,300
It's normal for teammates to fight sometimes, isn't it?

303
00:16:37,300 --> 00:16:37,940
Hmm.

304
00:16:37,940 --> 00:16:39,480
Normal?

305
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:42,420
