350
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:56,260
Shochew with hot water.

351
00:19:04,360 --> 00:19:05,000
Shochew with hot water.

352
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:10,020
I am beside you.

353
00:19:10,020 --> 00:19:40,000
Let's go.

354
00:19:40,020 --> 00:20:10,000
Let's go.

355
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:14,680
What did you do without me for the five days I was gone?

356
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:23,600
I was a ball boy.

357
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:35,660
Do you have a key to the club room or the gym?

358
00:20:36,360 --> 00:20:37,980
Mmm, shit.

359
00:20:37,980 --> 00:20:38,980
Let's go.

360
