There was a tiny giant.

368
00:21:07,800 --> 00:21:14,580
He was 170 centimeters tall, give or take.

369
00:21:15,140 --> 00:21:16,800
I've never seen him in monthly volleyball.

370
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:25,580
But I guarantee, of all the guys they invited to that intensive, he was one of the best.

371
00:21:26,480 --> 00:21:26,980
God.

372
00:21:26,980 --> 00:21:31,220
He was a hundred times better than you.

373
